g more C4724 warnings:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1824\" height=\"160\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-07-24 201347\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4589b918-ef14-4a5b-afd7-c2352f498102\" />\r\n\r\nI don't know how it's possible that more of these are appearing out of nowhere, even on an old branch: https://github.com/aaronfranke/godot/actions/runs/30139888717/job/89631104138\r\n\r\nI can reproduce them locally on Windows 11, so maybe it's a newer MSVC that is causing these warnings to appear.\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes them in master, and the fixes should be backported to all supported branches. This PR as-is can be automatically cherry-picked to 4.5, 4.6, and 4.7, but conflicts prevent cherry-picking to 4.4 and earlier.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starre